 ```
 
 
+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links in ZIP and Squashfs archives are skipped by default. Use
+`-l/--links` to expose them as files with a `.rclonelink` suffix containing
+the link target path. The archive backend does not follow symbolic links.
+
+Copying with `--links` recreates the links on destinations that support them,
+for example the local filesystem:
+
+```sh
+rclone copy --links :archive:/tmp/test.zip /tmp/out
+```
+
+Regular archive members whose names end in `.rclonelink` are read unchanged.
+
 ## Modification times
 
 Modification times are preserved with an accuracy depending on the archive type.
